    "result": {
      "schemaVersion": "knowledge-qa-result-v1",
      "answerability": "ANSWERED",
      "answer": "不能。浏览器、展示名、用户名、owner请求头或角色文字都不决定归属；身份归属固定由issuer+audience+organization决定，其中tenant映射为local-agentic，userId为IdP稳定sub[1]。",
      "citations": [
